# Moddy Arena: the battle arena control panel, used the way a player uses it. He arrives and sees the big board on the
# wall beside the gate: its title, the wave size (5) and the difficulty (Normal) with a down and an up button each,
# what the size means (the first and the last wave's monsters), and the start button on its green blocks. He walks up
# to it and presses each selector (he looks at the button and uses it): the number and the word on the board change,
# each press is said on his action bar, and a press past either end says so. He sets wave size 10 and Extreme, starts
# the battle, and the waves that come are that: wave 1 is 6 husks with half again their health (30), wave 2 is 10
# pillagers (Extreme's wave 2), wave 5 brings ravagers. In the battle the board shows its state and a selector does
# nothing but say so. After the battle the board keeps his settings.
# A resistance effect keeps him on his feet; the monsters are removed by command (the battle itself is
# 4-battle-won's). That the settings survive a restart is a unit test (the saved record) and a dedicated server's
# restart, since a playtest cannot restart its game (arena/README.md).
# play-timeout: 900
@intent the control panel on the prep room's wall shows the wave size and difficulty in big words, its selectors change them with feedback, the battle's waves follow them, and in a battle the board shows its state and the selectors are refused
@world flat seed=1

@step he arrives and sees the board
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@expect chat control panel within 10s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 900 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 900 0 true
scoreboard objectives add arenatest dummy
# the board: black concrete over the window beside and above the gate, blue selector blocks, green start blocks
@assert execute if block -2 67 16 minecraft:black_concrete
@assert execute if block 0 66 16 minecraft:black_concrete
@assert execute if block 0 64 16 minecraft:oak_fence_gate
@assert execute if block -4 66 16 minecraft:light_blue_concrete
@assert execute if block -1 65 16 minecraft:light_blue_concrete
@assert execute if block 3 65 16 minecraft:lime_concrete
@assert execute if block 3 64 16 minecraft:lime_concrete
@assert execute if block -4 66 17 minecraft:stone_button
@assert execute if block -1 66 17 minecraft:stone_button
@assert execute if block -4 65 17 minecraft:stone_button
@assert execute if block -1 65 17 minecraft:stone_button
@assert execute if block 3 65 17 minecraft:stone_button
# its words: twelve lines, each once
execute store result score #lines arenatest if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel]
@assert execute if score #lines arenatest matches 12
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_title,nbt={text:{text:"BATTLE ARENA CONTROL PANEL"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_size_value,nbt={text:{text:"5"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_value,nbt={text:{text:"Normal"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_size_means,nbt={text:{text:"First wave: 3 monsters\nLast wave: 10 monsters"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_start_label,nbt={text:{text:"START BATTLE"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"Ready! Press START."}}]
# the pictures: where he stands when he arrives, facing the arena and the board, empty-handed (the chat faded), and
# 3 blocks from the board, straight on
@key key.hotbar.3
@wait 12s
@shot standing-in-the-room
teleport @s 0.5 64 20 180 -2
@wait 11s
@shot three-blocks-away

@step he walks up to it
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@key key.forward hold 15t
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @s[x=-1,y=63,z=17,dx=3,dy=3,dz=2.5]

@step the wave size goes down, then up to 10, and no further
@aim pos -3.5 66.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Wave size 4: the first wave has 2 monsters, the last has 8 within 3s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_size_value,nbt={text:{text:"4"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_size_means,nbt={text:{text:"First wave: 2 monsters\nLast wave: 8 monsters"}}]
@aim pos -0.5 66.5 17.1
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Wave size 5 within 3s
@repeat 5
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@expect actionbar Wave size 10: the first wave has 6 monsters, the last has 20 within 3s
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar The wave size is already the biggest within 3s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_size_value,nbt={text:{text:"10"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_size_means,nbt={text:{text:"First wave: 6 monsters\nLast wave: 20 monsters"}}]

@step the difficulty goes down to Easy and no further, then up to Extreme and no further
@aim pos -3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Easy within 3s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_value,nbt={text:{text:"Easy"}}]
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Easy is already the easiest within 3s
@aim pos -0.5 65.5 17.1
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Normal within 3s
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Hard within 3s
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Extreme within 3s
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Extreme is already the hardest within 3s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_value,nbt={text:{text:"Extreme"}}]

@step he starts the battle, and wave 1 follows the panel: 6 husks with half again their health
# a step back from the board, so the start button is in front of him
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@key key.forward hold 12t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
execute store result score #n arenatest if entity @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if score #n arenatest matches 6
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,type=!minecraft:husk]
execute store result score #hp arenatest run attribute @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave,limit=1] minecraft:max_health get
@assert execute if score #hp arenatest matches 30
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"Battle on: wave 1 of 5"}}]

@step in the battle a selector does nothing but say so
@aim pos -0.5 66.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar A battle is on. Change the wave size and difficulty when it is over within 3s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_size_value,nbt={text:{text:"10"}}]
# the picture: from where he arrived, in the battle (its boss bar above, the board's state under START BATTLE)
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10s
@expect bossbar Wave 1 of 5 within 2s
@shot during-the-battle

@step wave 2 on Extreme is pillagers, 10 of them
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 10s
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
execute store result score #n arenatest if entity @e[type=minecraft:pillager,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if score #n arenatest matches 10
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,type=!minecraft:pillager]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"Battle on: wave 2 of 5"}}]
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 2 cleared within 10s

@step waves 3 and 4
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:vindicator,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave]
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 3 cleared within 10s
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 4 cleared within 10s

@step the last wave brings ravagers, and the battle is won
@expect title Wave 5 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
execute store result score #n arenatest if entity @e[type=minecraft:ravager,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if score #n arenatest matches 4
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat You won the battle within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 15s

@step after the battle the board keeps his settings and is ready again
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"Ready! Press START."}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_size_value,nbt={text:{text:"10"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_value,nbt={text:{text:"Extreme"}}]
execute store result score #lines arenatest if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel]
@assert execute if score #lines arenatest matches 12
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 15t
@wait 1s
@aim pos -0.5 66.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar The wave size is already the biggest within 3s
